      "nameKey": "TheoremWheel",
      "description": "Harmonic proportion study (design lab, 2026-11-02): one module u = R/16; bands sized from their content, planet band 3.6 u, cusp labels 0.9 u, aspect disc takes the rest; strokes on a √2 ladder anchored on the planet glyph stem; ticks 1 : 0.6 : 0.35. Values authored at the 400 px reference radius. Renderer-only values (stroke, type and tick-length tiers; the daemon validator does not take tickLength) live in appearance.",
